    <item>
      <title>2.8.0</title>
      <description>
        <![CDATA[
          <ul>
            <li>Agent clipboard API: AI agents can leave values in your history with a label (which session) and a note (where to run it), and read, pin, move, copy, relabel or delete items.</li>
            <li>Labels show as a chip on the row, notes on hover and in the preview; search matches both.</li>
          </ul>
        ]]>
      </description>
