    <item>
      <title>2.6.9</title>
      <description>
        <![CDATA[
          <ul>
            <li>New condition "Path type": match only file paths, or only folder paths — the path is checked on disk.</li>
            <li>Lets one rule open files in their app while another opens folders in Finder.</li>
          </ul>
        ]]>
